\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces MemoryAgentBench; scores are official component scores $\times 100$. Task rows and the Overall ($n{=}767$) row use the paired sample shared by both engines. $^{\ddagger }$ marks the two task groups added when the Align+ engine was extended in place to $n{=}1074$ (RULER-421K multi-hop QA and the full Redial recommendation corpus); the Base run was frozen at the paired sample, and both task groups exceed the full-context row's strict character budget (\cref  {app:sampling}), so they carry no same-model coverage. The Overall ($n{=}1074$) row is that extended sample; scores from the two samples are never subtracted. Bold/underlined entries are best/second-best within each task and sample, $^{*}$ marks sampled LongMemEval-S, and $^{\dagger }$ marks the singleton $\infty $Bench-Sum row of the paired sample (a second task group enters only the extended sample, so LRU remains directional: $n{=}7$ paired, $14$ extended).}}{6}{table.caption.8}\protected@file@percent }
